flowchart LR
  accTitle: Backend credential readiness paths after pull request 443
  accDescr: Routine readiness reads production-backend secret-name and variable metadata without an Environment gate, while a separate manual audit remains behind the production-backend approval gate for injected-value and shape checks.

  routine["Backend Credential Readiness\nno production-backend Environment"] --> metadata["GitHub Environment metadata\nsecret names and non-secret variables"]
  metadata --> checker["Credential readiness checker\nmissing required names fail closed"]
  audit["Backend Protected Value Audit\nmanual, production-backend Environment"] --> values["Injected values and shape checks"]
  protected["production-backend approval gate"] --> audit
